abstract: >-
  CALIPER is a reproducible research artifact for designing, executing, and
  analyzing factorial LLM evaluation experiments with explicit attention to
  variance, statistical power, and ranking stability. It supports Paper 1
  confirmatory HumanEval+ analyses (variance facets, binomial mixed models,
  task-sampling stability, and design guidance) and Paper 2 ranking-fragility
  workflows. This v1.0.0 release is the first public research archive intended
  for Zenodo deposition alongside Paper 1.
